{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>And I shall give peace in the land.</b> Rashi's comment: and so it says, ״עושה שלום ובורא את הכל.״ Hazal's question: behold, in the verse it is written ״יוצר אור ובורא חושך עושה שלום ובורא רע.״" "<b>And I shall cause to cease the evil beast.</b> Of it is said: ״זאב וטלה ירעו כאחד.״" "<b>[from the land.</b> This is an additional blessing — that the evil beasts shall not dwell near domesticated livestock.]"], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {0 "The quote in Rashi's name differs slightly from the text of Rashi on this verse."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:15:26.754658202Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}